WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 38=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:43.200 --> 01:44.560
The Lin Residence is so large,

01:45.120 --> 01:46.079
and with the retreat,

01:46.424 --> 01:47.710
there are over a hundred people.

01:48.232 --> 01:50.328
We can't go without
someone running the household.

01:55.959 --> 01:57.280
What you mean is...

01:59.040 --> 02:00.760
Xiulai, you're able to run a household,

02:01.144 --> 02:02.070
so the Lin Residence

02:02.599 --> 02:04.000
is in your hands to run.

02:06.359 --> 02:07.560
No, I can't.

02:08.159 --> 02:09.759
I'm separated and back with my family.

02:09.800 --> 02:12.240
If you don't mind me living off you,
I'll be forever grateful.

02:12.310 --> 02:14.024
I'm in no position to run the household.

02:14.616 --> 02:16.000
You'll manage the household for me,

02:16.199 --> 02:17.759
and I'll pay you every month,

02:18.240 --> 02:20.000
and a share of profits if you do well.

02:20.400 --> 02:21.599
Then from now on,

02:21.599 --> 02:22.439
in the Lin Residence,

02:22.439 --> 02:24.319
you'll earn your keep on your own merit.

02:24.856 --> 02:25.560
That's right.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.319
Lanxiang is right.

02:27.680 --> 02:28.159
Xiulai...

02:28.159 --> 02:29.199
Stop making a fuss.

02:33.039 --> 02:33.520
Lanxiang,

02:34.240 --> 02:35.080
I really can't.

02:35.919 --> 02:38.280
Do you really want to live off
the Lin family forever?

02:39.719 --> 02:40.560
Your dowry

02:40.560 --> 02:42.159
was squandered by the Lu family.

02:42.560 --> 02:44.639
Are you planning to remarry, then?

02:47.080 --> 02:48.240
I have no such intention.

02:49.520 --> 02:50.439
Yingzhi is still young.

02:50.856 --> 02:52.870
Once Jun returns, I'll have
a son and a daughter.

02:53.400 --> 02:55.639
I just want to raise them well.

02:56.520 --> 02:57.879
I'll never remarry in this life.

02:58.960 --> 03:00.560
If you don't plan to remarry,

03:00.580 --> 03:02.150
then you'll live in the Lin Residence

03:02.184 --> 03:03.310
for the rest of your life.

03:04.400 --> 03:06.039
You may be willing to bite your tongue

03:06.080 --> 03:07.159
and tiptoe around everyone,

03:07.759 --> 03:09.560
but what about Yingzhi and Jun?

03:13.439 --> 03:14.680
Think further ahead.

03:15.879 --> 03:17.879
Jun's betrothal gifts when he marries,

03:18.319 --> 03:19.520
and Yingzhi's dowry...

03:20.240 --> 03:22.120
will those come from living off others?

03:35.800 --> 03:36.360
Lanxiang,

03:36.664 --> 03:38.400
it's not that Xiulai doesn't understand.

03:39.319 --> 03:40.639
But if she runs the household,

03:41.479 --> 03:42.639
she's bound to face gossip.

03:43.096 --> 03:44.750
Running the household may draw gossip,

03:45.400 --> 03:46.759
but it comes with real power.

03:47.560 --> 03:49.840
For the sake of their monthly allowance,

03:50.120 --> 03:51.719
they won't dare say it to her face.

03:52.159 --> 03:54.080
They'll only gossip behind her back.

03:55.120 --> 03:55.840
There's no way

03:56.088 --> 03:57.310
that a woman who dared to go

03:57.319 --> 03:59.159
to Shuntian Prefecture
to sue for a separation

03:59.599 --> 04:01.199
would fear a few wagging tongues.

04:03.680 --> 04:04.400
Besides,

04:04.840 --> 04:06.150
people's hearts change easily.

04:06.919 --> 04:07.919
If you do well,

04:09.080 --> 04:11.599
they may be truly won over one day.

04:12.039 --> 04:13.080
Who knows?

04:15.479 --> 04:16.439
But Lanxiang,

04:18.632 --> 04:20.830
you're the wife
of the Lin family's eldest grandson.

04:21.759 --> 04:22.879
By doing this,

04:23.160 --> 04:25.879
aren't you afraid the Old Master
and First Madam will disapprove

04:26.120 --> 04:27.199
and punish you?

04:27.759 --> 04:28.639
Me?

04:34.279 --> 04:35.920
I've got thick skin.

04:37.600 --> 04:39.920
The Old Master and First Madam
already dislike me.

04:40.399 --> 04:42.319
At worst, they'll dislike me even more.

04:42.800 --> 04:44.279
Anyway, they're in Jinling,

04:44.360 --> 04:45.560
too far away to reach us.

04:45.920 --> 04:46.879
We're in the capital,

04:47.240 --> 04:49.120
so let's enjoy ourselves while we can.

04:54.079 --> 04:54.680
Xiulai,

04:55.279 --> 04:56.839
we should learn from Lanxiang.

04:57.439 --> 05:00.279
This world has enough rules as it is.

05:01.600 --> 05:02.399
People

05:02.744 --> 05:04.240
should look after themselves first.

05:07.079 --> 05:08.120
Have you figured it out?

05:09.600 --> 05:11.279
Don't worry, Xiulai.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.160
Lanxiang never acts recklessly.

05:13.519 --> 05:15.079
She must have thought it through.

05:15.848 --> 05:17.000
If she dares to suggest it,

05:17.319 --> 05:18.439
just go ahead and do it.

05:19.120 --> 05:20.319
If the sky falls,

05:20.712 --> 05:21.680
we'll face it together.

05:38.560 --> 05:39.600
Starting today,

05:39.816 --> 05:42.040
the First Young Lady
will manage the household for me.

05:43.600 --> 05:45.360
I have one reminder for you.

05:46.519 --> 05:48.560
We Lins are all one family.

05:49.959 --> 05:51.360
The First Young Lady is a Lin.

05:52.120 --> 05:54.399
The Young Master
chose to take 200 strokes

05:54.920 --> 05:56.160
to protect her.

05:57.560 --> 05:59.160
If anyone thinks of bullying her,

06:00.279 --> 06:03.040
first consider whether
the Young Master would allow it.

06:05.820 --> 06:10.820
♪Faded ink turns fragrant,
spring rises and summer grows♪

06:10.820 --> 06:14.140
♪As if time itself were flowing♪

06:14.140 --> 06:17.620
♪Pausing, then rewinding♪

06:21.399 --> 06:22.879
I know some of the nannies

06:23.199 --> 06:25.560
and stewards are longtime servants here,

06:26.279 --> 06:27.519
and are well respected.

06:29.112 --> 06:31.360
But since I've promised Lanxiang
to run the household,

06:32.160 --> 06:33.959
I have my own respect to uphold.

06:35.160 --> 06:37.000
From now on, if you respect me,

06:37.959 --> 06:39.439
I'll rely on you in return.

06:41.040 --> 06:42.720
But if you use your seniority

06:43.120 --> 06:44.439
to do something shameful,

06:45.279 --> 06:47.680
as a junior, I can't punish you myself.

06:48.456 --> 06:50.830
I'll just tie you up and bring you
before the Old Master,

06:51.279 --> 06:52.040
the Old Madam,

06:52.720 --> 06:54.079
the Master and First Madam,

06:54.536 --> 06:56.070
and let them decide your punishment.

06:57.976 --> 06:59.310
Rest assured, First Young Lady.

06:59.759 --> 07:02.120
We'd never dare to abuse our seniority.

07:02.900 --> 07:05.860
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

07:05.860 --> 07:09.140
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

07:09.540 --> 07:16.340
♪The past falls like withered leaves
into the dust♪

07:17.439 --> 07:19.000
Lanxiang is truly one of a kind.

07:19.920 --> 07:22.240
She even thought of having Xiulai
run the household.

07:23.944 --> 07:25.190
At first, it seems unreasonable,

07:25.600 --> 07:27.600
but on reflection, it's perfectly sound.

07:29.240 --> 07:30.839
Remarkable people do remarkable things.

07:31.759 --> 07:33.800
No wonder you took a slap back then

07:34.040 --> 07:35.240
just to marry her.

07:42.600 --> 07:44.160
Stop teasing me.

07:44.879 --> 07:46.120
More importantly, your health...

07:46.600 --> 07:47.480
how is it?

07:48.399 --> 07:49.800
I heard that today

07:50.040 --> 07:51.319
you sent for a physician.

07:54.519 --> 07:55.600
I have good news

07:55.959 --> 07:57.839
to share with you and Lanxiang.

08:00.000 --> 08:00.439
All right.

08:01.279 --> 08:02.120
I'm all ears.

08:04.759 --> 08:05.800
Suhua is with child.

08:08.120 --> 08:08.959
You mean

08:11.160 --> 08:12.319
you're going to be a father?

08:15.959 --> 08:16.759
Wonderful.

08:17.279 --> 08:18.079
Congratulations.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.959
If the Old Master finds out,

08:20.319 --> 08:21.360
he'll be overjoyed.

08:21.800 --> 08:22.839
Write a letter right away,

08:22.840 --> 08:24.110
and I'll have it sent to Jinling.

08:24.120 --> 08:24.680
Jinqi.

08:28.319 --> 08:29.720
I'd like to ask you a favor.

08:30.600 --> 08:32.120
Don't tell anyone in Jinling yet.

08:35.559 --> 08:37.759
You don't want Concubine Zhou to know?

08:40.120 --> 08:41.320
Ever since I was born,

08:42.000 --> 08:43.600
Mother has cared for me devotedly.

08:45.120 --> 08:49.120
She kept watch over what I wore,
what I ate, and how I slept.

08:51.039 --> 08:52.399
Nagged me constantly,

08:54.080 --> 08:55.000
"You're in poor health.

08:56.000 --> 08:57.960
You can't do this,
and you can't do that."

09:00.600 --> 09:02.080
It was almost suffocating.

09:04.080 --> 09:04.879
I thought

09:05.360 --> 09:06.799
things would improve after I married,

09:08.200 --> 09:10.240
but Mother watched Suhua closely, too.

09:11.799 --> 09:13.200
Mother kept blaming Suhua

09:13.200 --> 09:14.799
for years of marriage without a child.

09:16.080 --> 09:17.080
But Suhua

09:18.080 --> 09:19.159
was so frightened by Mother

09:19.208 --> 09:20.750
that even staying with me a bit longer,

09:21.399 --> 09:23.080
she feared it would drain my vitality.

09:24.559 --> 09:25.759
How could she get pregnant?

09:30.200 --> 09:33.120
Concubine Zhou was only
worried about your health.

09:37.759 --> 09:38.919
Now that I'm in the capital,

09:40.559 --> 09:42.960
without Mother shadowing my every move,

09:45.159 --> 09:46.279
I finally feel

09:48.519 --> 09:49.600
truly alive.

09:51.679 --> 09:52.759
Unfilial son that I am,

09:53.559 --> 09:54.480
I've grown too fond of

09:55.399 --> 09:57.080
this feeling of truly living.

10:00.919 --> 10:02.399
I really don't want Mother to come.

10:08.039 --> 10:08.720
All right.

10:09.679 --> 10:11.720
I'll keep this from them for you,

10:12.104 --> 10:13.750
and not let our elders in Jinling know.

10:15.879 --> 10:18.279
Thank you and Lanxiang
for covering for me.

10:20.720 --> 10:22.039
Lanxiang isn't here,

10:22.159 --> 10:23.159
so your flattery

10:23.799 --> 10:24.720
is wasted.

10:29.320 --> 10:31.080
You've been married for over a year,

10:31.480 --> 10:32.960
yet still living in this warm chamber.

10:36.799 --> 10:37.840
Is it still the bitter part

10:38.320 --> 10:39.240
before the sweet?

10:44.840 --> 10:46.000
(Our ways)

10:47.080 --> 10:47.879
(differ.)

10:50.480 --> 10:51.120
Jinlan,

10:51.800 --> 10:53.940
those who follow different ways
cannot plan together.

10:54.440 --> 10:55.279
What is the Way?

10:56.248 --> 10:57.360
The Way that can be spoken

10:58.080 --> 10:59.000
is not the eternal Way.

11:01.448 --> 11:02.870
That's too big a question, Jinqi.

11:03.159 --> 11:05.080
I can't think of how to answer.

11:05.570 --> 11:06.759
The Way of the gentleman is to

11:07.320 --> 11:11.360
cultivate oneself, order the family,
govern the state, and pacify the realm.

11:12.080 --> 11:12.840
Is that wrong?

11:14.519 --> 11:16.679
You just quelled Prince Han's rebellion,

11:17.000 --> 11:19.200
bringing peace and well-being to all.

11:19.919 --> 11:21.039
What you've done

11:21.159 --> 11:23.720
leaves you no shame
before Heaven or mankind.

11:23.736 --> 11:24.850
It is surely the right Way.

11:27.159 --> 11:29.279
Now just wait for His Majesty's reward.

11:31.460 --> 11:32.980
(Deep Roots, Lasting Grace)

11:32.980 --> 11:35.460
(Six Months Later)

11:35.460 --> 11:37.660
(Deep Roots, Lasting Grace)

11:38.240 --> 11:41.799
By the mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees.

11:42.600 --> 11:47.240
Lin Jinqi, Assistant Commander
of the Central Military Command,

11:47.879 --> 11:49.960
when traitors rebelled,

11:50.320 --> 11:53.080
you were charged to defend the capital.

11:53.480 --> 11:55.799
With keen and decisive judgment,

11:56.080 --> 11:58.639
you defeated the enemy and prevailed.

11:59.600 --> 12:02.840
We hereby confer upon you the title
of Guardian Serving Heaven's Mandate,

12:03.080 --> 12:05.200
Loyal and Dedicated Military Minister,

12:05.784 --> 12:07.864
Specially Promoted Grand Master of

12:07.870 --> 12:10.150
Glorious Emolument,
Right Pillar of State,

12:10.639 --> 12:13.279
Left Chief Commander
of the Rear Military Command,

12:13.519 --> 12:14.799
and Marquis Jing'an.

12:15.320 --> 12:19.120
Xu, wife of Lin Jinqi, Marquis Jing'an,

12:19.480 --> 12:20.910
in a time of peril for the realm,

12:21.200 --> 12:22.720
remained unwavering in resolve

12:23.039 --> 12:24.519
and upheld virtue in practice.

12:25.200 --> 12:28.919
She is hereby granted the title
of Marchioness Jing'an.

12:29.000 --> 12:33.000
Receive this grace with reverence
and forever grace your household.

12:33.816 --> 12:35.112
Your Majesty is most gracious.

12:35.399 --> 12:37.840
I would give my life to repay it.

12:37.960 --> 12:39.960
Thanks Your Majesty for this grace.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.720
Great news!

13:10.720 --> 13:11.759
(Glorify the Family Name)

13:11.759 --> 13:12.600
Great news!

13:13.480 --> 13:14.399
Great news!

13:15.360 --> 13:17.600
Wonderful news!

13:18.559 --> 13:20.440
Old Master, Old Madam,

13:20.799 --> 13:22.679
our Young Master crushed the rebellion,

13:22.759 --> 13:24.720
and His Majesty made him Marquis Jing'an

13:25.120 --> 13:27.440
and Left Chief Commander
of the Rear Military Command!

13:28.639 --> 13:32.240
The Young Madam was named
Marchioness Jing'an!

13:33.360 --> 13:34.759
Is the news certain?

13:34.960 --> 13:36.559
Yes, it's certain.

13:36.960 --> 13:39.200
Marquis Yuan told me himself.

13:39.759 --> 13:40.759
Marquis Jing'an...

13:41.759 --> 13:42.759
Marquis Jing'an...

13:42.919 --> 13:45.120
I'm the father of Marquis Jing'an!

13:46.399 --> 13:47.759
By custom,

13:48.120 --> 13:49.279
when a son is ennobled,

13:49.279 --> 13:52.039
he should petition His Majesty
to grant titles to his parents,

13:52.360 --> 13:54.879
no lower in rank than his own.

13:55.879 --> 13:58.960
Then I'll be a marquis, too!

14:00.120 --> 14:02.679
And you'll be a marchioness.

14:04.120 --> 14:05.840
It's only an honorary title.

14:06.200 --> 14:08.240
Nothing more than a name.

14:09.039 --> 14:10.960
Shunhua!

14:11.399 --> 14:12.279
Did you hear?

14:12.559 --> 14:14.480
You're going to be a marchioness!

14:17.799 --> 14:18.759
Did you hear?

14:18.760 --> 14:21.448
(Cheng Fengxian, Lin Jinqiao's Wife)
Your sister-in-law is a marchioness now.

14:22.120 --> 14:22.879
That's right.

14:23.159 --> 14:25.200
My eldest brother
is Marquis Jing'an now.

14:28.248 --> 14:29.240
The Marquis also said

14:29.310 --> 14:30.900
His Majesty has issued a special decree.

14:30.919 --> 14:33.120
Jiugao and Nanke
may leave bonded status.

14:33.320 --> 14:36.960
Jiugao is named company commander,
and Nanke deputy company commander!

14:38.552 --> 14:39.870
Congratulations, Your Lordship.

14:40.279 --> 14:41.720
Congratulations, Marchioness.

14:41.736 --> 14:42.960
Thank you, Chief Steward Wang,

14:43.080 --> 14:44.320
for coming in person.

14:44.840 --> 14:46.519
Getting to share in the joy

14:47.000 --> 14:48.639
is my good fortune.

14:50.159 --> 14:51.480
In quelling this rebellion,

14:53.159 --> 14:54.919
Jiugao and Nanke

14:55.480 --> 14:57.240
also rendered great service.

14:57.960 --> 14:59.320
The Marquis submitted a memorial

14:59.320 --> 15:01.120
requesting rewards for them,

15:01.360 --> 15:02.919
and His Majesty has approved it.

15:16.960 --> 15:20.639
Amitabha.

15:21.159 --> 15:22.080
Old Master,

15:22.360 --> 15:24.200
even the Lin family's servants

15:24.280 --> 15:25.670
have made something of themselves.

15:26.679 --> 15:27.720
Marquis Jing'an...

15:30.120 --> 15:31.440
Old Master, Old Madam,

15:31.840 --> 15:32.679
although

15:32.960 --> 15:35.320
the clan has precedents
for celebratory rites,

15:35.519 --> 15:37.960
the clan has never had a marquis.

15:38.399 --> 15:39.320
For now, I'm at a loss

15:39.519 --> 15:40.960
as to how to arrange it.

15:41.200 --> 15:42.879
Please, Old Master and Old Madam,

15:42.960 --> 15:44.039
make the decision.

15:45.559 --> 15:46.639
Then invite

15:47.399 --> 15:49.600
the clan elders over to discuss it

15:50.000 --> 15:51.039
and settle on a plan.

15:51.480 --> 15:51.879
Good.

15:51.879 --> 15:52.320
Very good.

15:52.399 --> 15:53.039
Very good.

15:54.279 --> 15:54.960
Good.

15:55.480 --> 15:57.440
This is truly wonderful news!

16:00.200 --> 16:00.879
Wonderful!

16:09.864 --> 16:10.200
Old...

16:10.360 --> 16:11.000
Old Madam!

16:13.120 --> 16:13.759
Old Madam!

16:16.480 --> 16:17.720
- Mother!
- What do we do?

16:17.799 --> 16:18.320
What do we do?

16:18.320 --> 16:19.360
- Mother!
- Mother!

16:19.360 --> 16:19.960
What's wrong?

16:20.039 --> 16:21.279
Mother, what's wrong?

16:21.279 --> 16:22.720
Stop! Don't move her!

16:22.720 --> 16:24.240
Stand aside. Don't get in the way!

16:24.440 --> 16:25.240
Mother!

16:26.200 --> 16:27.840
Huaixiang, fetch a basin of hot water.

16:28.159 --> 16:30.799
Mother, are you all right?

16:31.440 --> 16:32.960
Madam Wu, get the medicine chest.

16:32.984 --> 16:34.480
Huaixiang, fetch a basin of hot water!

16:34.480 --> 16:35.600
Hurry!

16:38.360 --> 16:39.039
Yinchen!

16:40.000 --> 16:40.399
Hurry.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.159
Go, quickly.

16:41.279 --> 16:42.240
My stomach hurts.

16:42.600 --> 16:43.440
Jinqiao!

16:43.480 --> 16:44.600
My stomach hurts!

16:44.600 --> 16:45.679
The baby's coming.

16:45.679 --> 16:47.639
Why did it have to happen now?

16:49.080 --> 16:49.870
Call the midwife!

16:49.960 --> 16:50.720
My stomach hurts.

16:50.720 --> 16:51.639
I'll fetch a physician!

16:55.336 --> 16:56.720
What are you standing there for?

16:56.799 --> 16:57.919
Help your wife, quickly!

16:59.519 --> 17:00.000
Careful.

17:00.639 --> 17:02.200
Careful...

17:09.680 --> 17:10.279
Lanxiang,

17:11.079 --> 17:12.359
here are this month's accounts.

17:12.359 --> 17:15.380
(Harmonious Joy)

17:17.039 --> 17:18.400
263 taels.

17:19.640 --> 17:21.400
Such a large surplus this month?

17:22.720 --> 17:24.039
Xiulai, you're truly capable.

17:29.480 --> 17:30.640
Besides the accounts,

17:30.776 --> 17:31.920
there's something important

17:31.920 --> 17:33.079
I'd like to discuss with you.

17:34.480 --> 17:34.960
Go ahead.

17:36.799 --> 17:39.039
Jinqi now serves His Majesty directly,

17:39.599 --> 17:41.400
so you're sure to stay in the capital.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.200
I was thinking

17:43.272 --> 17:44.680
we could buy, here in the capital,

17:44.728 --> 17:45.750
some land and houses.

17:47.079 --> 17:48.240
We may not need them now,

17:48.680 --> 17:50.200
but once there are children,

17:50.296 --> 17:51.640
for weddings and dowries alike,

17:51.688 --> 17:52.590
they'll come in handy.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.599
You make a good point, Xiulai.

17:56.799 --> 17:58.079
But first,

17:58.480 --> 18:01.160
land and houses here are very costly.

18:01.640 --> 18:03.039
We may not be able to afford them.

18:03.720 --> 18:06.359
Second, the capital is only so big.

18:06.720 --> 18:08.599
Land and houses are limited.

18:09.039 --> 18:10.039
We can't just buy them

18:10.039 --> 18:11.279
because we want to.

18:11.839 --> 18:13.000
You're right,

18:13.279 --> 18:15.279
but you forget the rebellion last year.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.720
Many families met with disaster.

18:18.160 --> 18:19.599
Their houses and land

18:19.600 --> 18:21.000
have gradually come on the market.

18:21.319 --> 18:21.920
Now

18:22.279 --> 18:23.839
is a good time to buy.

18:25.519 --> 18:26.160
That's right.

18:26.799 --> 18:27.920
How could I forget?

18:28.680 --> 18:30.960
The Zhao and Dai families alone

18:30.960 --> 18:32.440
had plenty of land and houses.

18:34.680 --> 18:36.640
Xiulai, you truly are a born manager.

18:37.359 --> 18:39.240
There's no better time than now

18:39.359 --> 18:40.559
to buy land and property.

18:41.079 --> 18:42.000
I've asked around.

18:42.319 --> 18:44.480
The families of Grand Secretary Xie
and Duke Ying

18:44.720 --> 18:46.599
want 1,000 mu of fertile farmland.

18:47.240 --> 18:49.440
And the Eldest Prince's Eunuch Wang

18:49.680 --> 18:51.160
and the Second Prince's Eunuch Gao

18:51.279 --> 18:53.359
also want over 1,000 mu each.

18:54.640 --> 18:56.240
Are eunuchs really that rich?

18:56.680 --> 18:59.279
They can buy that much at once?

19:00.680 --> 19:02.759
These eunuchs have no wives or children,

19:03.000 --> 19:04.559
and their food and clothes are provided.

19:05.119 --> 19:07.400
What would they want so much land for?

19:08.440 --> 19:09.720
Xiulai, do you know

19:10.400 --> 19:11.920
why Cao Cao's surname was Cao?

19:14.559 --> 19:17.680
Supposedly, Cao Cao was born a Xiahou,

19:18.319 --> 19:19.759
but because his father

19:19.920 --> 19:21.799
was adopted by the eunuch lord Cao Teng,

19:22.079 --> 19:23.759
the name was changed to Cao.

19:27.720 --> 19:28.880
How foolish of me.

19:29.279 --> 19:30.880
Eunuchs can have heirs, too.

19:31.359 --> 19:32.920
Of course land would be of great use.

19:35.000 --> 19:36.039
We women

19:36.039 --> 19:37.039
don't need that much,

19:37.480 --> 19:38.680
but it's a rare opportunity.

19:39.000 --> 19:39.960
If we pool our money,

19:40.119 --> 19:41.759
we can surely buy 100-200 mu.

19:42.799 --> 19:44.000
It'd bring in income

19:44.359 --> 19:46.359
and could be left to the children later.

19:53.599 --> 19:55.279
I have some private savings.

19:56.039 --> 19:58.119
If there's land at a fair price,

19:58.359 --> 19:59.519
could I join in

19:59.680 --> 20:01.119
and buy some for the child?

20:02.000 --> 20:03.400
Suhua, why so formal?

20:04.039 --> 20:05.319
We're looking anyway.

20:05.640 --> 20:07.119
We can ask Xiulai

20:07.160 --> 20:08.839
to look with Second Butler Yang,

20:09.680 --> 20:11.519
and then have Lanxiang
give final approval.

20:13.559 --> 20:14.559
Exactly.

20:15.279 --> 20:16.759
If we all buy together,

20:17.039 --> 20:18.279
we can look out for each other.

20:21.480 --> 20:23.599
I don't object if you want to buy,

20:24.119 --> 20:25.119
but I won't.

20:31.559 --> 20:33.400
Lanxiang, is your dowry not enough?

20:34.359 --> 20:34.920
I have money.

20:35.240 --> 20:36.359
Take it and use it.

20:37.720 --> 20:39.799
I have enough money for the land.

20:39.960 --> 20:40.519
Then...

20:40.920 --> 20:42.359
Did I not think it through?

20:42.680 --> 20:44.400
Did I get something wrong?

20:45.240 --> 20:46.519
No, you're not wrong, Xiulai.

20:47.240 --> 20:48.000
Right now

20:48.279 --> 20:48.920
is indeed

20:48.920 --> 20:50.960
a good time to acquire land and houses.

20:54.328 --> 20:55.720
If the Young Master wants to buy,

20:55.960 --> 20:57.640
let him vet it for you.

20:57.960 --> 20:59.160
I'll stay out of it.

21:04.319 --> 21:05.759
If Lanxiang isn't buying,

21:06.759 --> 21:07.920
then neither will I.

21:09.680 --> 21:11.799
I have no wish to marry now.

21:12.359 --> 21:14.039
As long as I have enough to live on,

21:14.359 --> 21:15.559
anything more is wasted.

21:16.759 --> 21:18.119
Then I won't buy either.

21:19.559 --> 21:20.799
The Second Young Master and I

21:20.800 --> 21:22.376
will surely return to Jinling someday.

21:23.200 --> 21:25.640
Buying land and houses in the capital

21:26.240 --> 21:27.440
really doesn't make sense.

21:29.240 --> 21:30.599
I don't have money anyway.

21:31.119 --> 21:33.599
I was just offering ideas

21:33.839 --> 21:34.799
and joining in the fun.

21:36.240 --> 21:37.519
Since none of you is buying,

21:39.519 --> 21:41.599
forget I brought it up.

22:05.160 --> 22:06.359
Different ways again...

22:08.559 --> 22:10.039
Lanxiang must miss her parents

22:10.519 --> 22:11.720
and want to go back to Jinling.

22:12.168 --> 22:13.720
That's why she won't buy property here.

22:28.119 --> 22:30.000
Xiuwan's clothes are just for show.

22:30.000 --> 22:31.240
Appreciate the thought,

22:31.519 --> 22:32.960
but never let the baby wear them.

22:35.559 --> 22:37.160
Jinqi, you're such a tease.

22:37.359 --> 22:38.759
I made them for fun.

22:39.440 --> 22:40.559
Suhua, you're with child.

22:40.759 --> 22:42.440
No need to stand. Please sit.

22:43.680 --> 22:45.119
Why did you come together?

22:47.240 --> 22:48.319
A letter came from Jinling.

22:49.079 --> 22:50.559
Jinqiao's wife had a son.

22:50.960 --> 22:52.240
Jinqiao is a father now.

22:54.160 --> 22:55.680
So Mother has a grandson.

22:56.359 --> 22:58.079
No wonder she never came to the capital

22:58.079 --> 22:58.920
to cause me trouble.

23:09.920 --> 23:11.240
There's other news from home?

23:14.920 --> 23:16.119
The Old Madam had a stroke.

23:17.519 --> 23:19.960
Fortunately, with careful treatment,

23:20.319 --> 23:21.559
her life is no longer in danger.

23:23.599 --> 23:24.839
But she has trouble moving,

23:25.000 --> 23:27.440
and her speech isn't as clear as before.

23:28.960 --> 23:30.240
Do we need to go back?

23:31.960 --> 23:34.119
The Old Master wants us in the capital,

23:34.480 --> 23:36.079
with no need to worry about home.

23:38.799 --> 23:40.720
But Aunt Lingxiao, as a daughter-in-law,

23:41.119 --> 23:42.720
must stay and tend to her.

23:43.160 --> 23:44.359
For the next year or so,

23:44.552 --> 23:46.104
she likely won't come to the capital.

23:50.984 --> 23:52.350
But in her letter, Aunt Lingxiao

23:52.440 --> 23:53.790
urged you to return to Jinling.

23:55.160 --> 23:55.799
She said

23:56.480 --> 23:58.039
now that Jinqi is Marquis Jing'an,

23:58.184 --> 24:00.760
the family can't bear to see you
marry so far away in the capital,

24:00.776 --> 24:02.648
and wants to find you
a good match in Jinling.

24:03.400 --> 24:04.599
I'm not going back.

24:05.599 --> 24:06.279
I won't.

24:08.240 --> 24:09.200
Jinqi, just tell her

24:09.480 --> 24:11.240
there are many fine young men here,

24:11.680 --> 24:13.599
that you and Lanxiang are matchmaking,

24:13.880 --> 24:15.759
so Mother needn't worry about my match.

24:16.559 --> 24:18.759
Lying to deceive our elders for you?

24:18.920 --> 24:19.799
I won't do that.

24:21.400 --> 24:22.480
And don't use Lanxiang

24:22.480 --> 24:23.640
as your shield.

24:23.720 --> 24:25.000
When Aunt Lingxiao makes a scene,

24:25.000 --> 24:27.200
even I can't fend off her volleys.

24:28.640 --> 24:29.599
Just kidding.

24:29.960 --> 24:32.160
The Old Master's letter
never even mentioned you.

24:34.519 --> 24:35.440
Jinlan!

24:35.512 --> 24:37.112
- You...
- It's only a matter of time.

24:38.160 --> 24:39.640
Aunt Lingxiao is too busy for you now,

24:39.784 --> 24:41.864
but she'll write to summon you
back soon enough.

24:42.680 --> 24:44.640
Men must wed, and women must marry.

24:45.119 --> 24:46.440
You can't escape it.

24:47.960 --> 24:49.079
You'd better plan ahead.

24:49.720 --> 24:50.480
Or sooner or later,

24:50.600 --> 24:52.216
your parents will lead you by the nose.

24:57.119 --> 24:57.720
Tomorrow,

24:58.160 --> 24:59.799
Lanxiang and I are going on an outing.

25:00.240 --> 25:01.519
No need to prepare meals for us.

25:02.200 --> 25:02.880
All right.

25:03.160 --> 25:03.960
I'll come, too.

25:04.160 --> 25:05.200
I'm bored stiff at home.

25:06.872 --> 25:07.720
You're not coming.

25:10.559 --> 25:11.240
Jinqi!

25:12.400 --> 25:13.119
Lanxiang!

25:18.359 --> 25:20.160
Jinlan, Suhua.

25:21.319 --> 25:23.519
Wherever we go, you're not coming.

25:23.839 --> 25:24.480
You...

25:29.079 --> 25:30.039
Fine, don't take me.

25:32.000 --> 25:33.720
You just want me married off.

25:34.039 --> 25:34.920
Not a chance.

25:53.359 --> 25:53.960
This way.

25:58.359 --> 25:59.079
Careful.

26:14.824 --> 26:15.960
We've walked all this way,

26:15.970 --> 26:18.190
and you've beaten the grass all along.
Aren't you tired?

26:18.550 --> 26:20.040
Beating the grass scares off snakes.

26:20.720 --> 26:21.400
Tiring as it is,

26:21.400 --> 26:23.559
it's better than a venomous snake bite.

26:27.256 --> 26:28.680
Young Master, what made you think

26:29.000 --> 26:30.680
of coming somewhere so remote to unwind?

26:31.799 --> 26:32.759
To visit an old friend.

26:34.839 --> 26:35.799
Why would your friend

26:36.279 --> 26:37.880
live somewhere so remote?

27:08.872 --> 27:10.440
Young Master, do you know that woman?

27:12.839 --> 27:13.640
I've seen her.

27:15.559 --> 27:16.759
She didn't recognize you.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.240
I've seen her.

27:22.079 --> 27:22.960
She's never seen me.

27:50.480 --> 27:51.240
We're here.

27:52.880 --> 27:54.559
This is the old friend I came to visit.

28:06.200 --> 28:07.119
This is

28:07.279 --> 28:08.079
a grave?

28:12.759 --> 28:14.160
A family grave.

28:14.839 --> 28:15.960
A family of twenty

28:17.079 --> 28:18.319
all buried here.

28:32.160 --> 28:33.079
Why does this grave

28:33.240 --> 28:34.640
have no headstone?

28:37.672 --> 28:38.984
Grand Secretary Shen's family,

28:39.016 --> 28:41.020
for deceiving the throne
and betraying its favor,

28:41.030 --> 28:42.310
and for disloyalty to the state,

28:43.320 --> 28:45.000
was ordered to die by the late Emperor.

28:47.900 --> 28:52.180
♪Spring slips
from the branches once more♪

28:54.860 --> 28:59.220
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

29:00.720 --> 29:02.039
Those who buried them

29:03.960 --> 29:05.359
didn't dare put up a headstone.

29:05.740 --> 29:08.180
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

29:08.620 --> 29:10.980
♪Though all the world may fade♪

29:10.980 --> 29:13.860
♪Time rolls on
as countless lives rush by♪

29:15.580 --> 29:20.140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

29:22.660 --> 29:27.060
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

29:28.740 --> 29:32.460
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

29:33.140 --> 29:35.700
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

29:36.820 --> 29:42.460
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

29:43.060 --> 29:47.140
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

29:47.140 --> 29:50.300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

29:50.300 --> 29:54.180
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

29:54.180 --> 29:56.980
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

29:56.980 --> 30:01.300
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

30:01.300 --> 30:04.300
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

30:04.300 --> 30:08.140
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

30:08.140 --> 30:12.460
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

30:17.839 --> 30:18.519
Jialan,

30:19.000 --> 30:20.440
we promised to meet no matter what.

30:20.440 --> 30:21.680
I've waited so long for you.

30:24.340 --> 30:28.820
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

30:28.820 --> 30:31.900
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

30:31.900 --> 30:35.820
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

30:35.820 --> 30:38.160
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

30:38.160 --> 30:39.000
Jialan.

30:39.000 --> 30:42.980
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

30:42.980 --> 30:45.980
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

30:45.980 --> 30:50.060
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

30:50.060 --> 30:54.480
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

30:54.480 --> 30:56.039
Sorry, I've come too late.

31:02.559 --> 31:03.279
What's wrong?

31:05.720 --> 31:06.440
What's wrong?

31:07.319 --> 31:08.039
Are you all right?

31:22.799 --> 31:24.119
I've been searching

31:25.480 --> 31:27.200
for where the Shen family was buried.

31:28.720 --> 31:29.480
I never thought

31:30.240 --> 31:31.240
it would be here.

31:34.920 --> 31:36.079
You knew the Shen family?

31:43.079 --> 31:44.519
Back when I was in the capital,

31:46.480 --> 31:47.799
I was gravely ill, near death.

31:48.960 --> 31:50.839
To pay for my treatment,

31:51.519 --> 31:53.400
my parents had spent all their savings.

31:54.920 --> 31:57.359
Penniless and out of options,

31:58.279 --> 32:01.440
we chanced upon First Madam Shen
and Young Lady Shen.

32:04.720 --> 32:07.000
The First Madam gave my parents
ten taels of silver.

32:09.279 --> 32:11.319
The Young Lady gave me a set of clothes.

32:35.160 --> 32:36.799
What a twist of fate.

32:38.720 --> 32:40.240
You actually met Young Lady Shen.

32:51.119 --> 32:52.960
I humbly thank First Madam Shen

32:53.480 --> 32:54.519
and Young Lady Shen

32:55.160 --> 32:56.759
for the kindness you showed my wife.

33:11.039 --> 33:12.000
How did you know

33:12.640 --> 33:14.200
the Shen family was buried here?

33:17.079 --> 33:18.799
The Young Lady Shen who gave you clothes

33:19.920 --> 33:20.920
was named Shen Jialan.

33:22.640 --> 33:24.039
She was once betrothed to me.

33:27.359 --> 33:28.920
After the Shen family fell,

33:30.200 --> 33:32.200
to protect my family's lives,

33:33.440 --> 33:35.200
we had to break off the engagement.

33:39.559 --> 33:41.240
I felt guilty and couldn't rest.

33:42.920 --> 33:43.920
So I paid handsomely

33:44.072 --> 33:45.310
for the public burial ground

33:45.920 --> 33:48.160
to gather the Shen family's remains

33:49.680 --> 33:50.799
and bury them here.

33:53.519 --> 33:55.119
I also worried that over time

33:55.640 --> 33:57.200
it would become a wild wasteland.

33:58.480 --> 33:59.400
So when

33:59.920 --> 34:01.839
the officials sold the Shen servants,

34:03.160 --> 34:03.920
I had someone

34:04.359 --> 34:06.440
buy back Madam Sun and Qiukui

34:07.839 --> 34:09.360
and helped them become free commoners.

34:10.119 --> 34:11.400
Madam Sun?

34:12.360 --> 34:13.400
Qiukui?

34:22.039 --> 34:23.599
It was Qiukui back then

34:24.920 --> 34:26.079
who gave me the clothes.

34:26.800 --> 34:27.920
I've always remembered her.

34:32.840 --> 34:34.079
You saw her not long ago.

34:38.199 --> 34:39.199
That woman

34:39.559 --> 34:40.559
was Qiukui?

34:45.559 --> 34:46.920
She goes by Li Sanniang now.

34:48.119 --> 34:49.800
She married the village carpenter.

34:50.440 --> 34:51.440
Now she's

34:52.599 --> 34:54.280
a mother of two sons and a daughter.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.239
Today

35:00.719 --> 35:01.880
we came face to face,

35:03.320 --> 35:04.719
yet she didn't know me.

35:10.599 --> 35:11.880
Many years have passed.

35:12.920 --> 35:14.400
It's normal not to recognize you.

35:16.199 --> 35:17.480
As long as she's living well.

35:22.840 --> 35:23.719
Yes.

35:28.079 --> 35:30.519
If Young Lady Shen can see from beyond,

35:32.119 --> 35:33.400
she can rest in peace.

35:38.119 --> 35:38.719
Today

35:40.400 --> 35:41.840
is Shen Jialan's birthday.

35:43.840 --> 35:45.039
I brought you here

35:46.519 --> 35:48.159
first, to pay respects to an old friend.

35:49.320 --> 35:50.400
Birthday?

35:52.360 --> 35:53.239
Today is...

35:54.800 --> 35:55.760
Birthday...

36:00.320 --> 36:01.079
Yes.

36:03.880 --> 36:05.559
Today is the 18th day of the 7th month.

36:07.960 --> 36:08.840
It is...

36:11.400 --> 36:13.440
It is Young Lady Shen's birthday.

36:20.039 --> 36:21.039
I'd forgotten.

36:22.920 --> 36:24.159
You still remembered.

36:30.400 --> 36:32.199
Though Shen Jialan and I were betrothed,

36:33.039 --> 36:34.159
we never met.

36:37.079 --> 36:37.920
It's just that

36:40.000 --> 36:41.760
I could never let it go.

36:45.920 --> 36:46.719
The Lin family

36:47.960 --> 36:49.320
wronged the Shen family.

36:51.480 --> 36:52.000
I...

36:55.239 --> 36:56.320
failed Shen Jialan.

36:58.119 --> 36:59.000
I...

37:01.239 --> 37:02.320
am truly no good husband.

37:04.000 --> 37:05.119
(Heaven above)

37:05.752 --> 37:07.110
(and Earth below bear witness.)

37:08.159 --> 37:10.960
(A righteous man gathered the remains)

37:11.199 --> 37:13.519
(of the Shen family and Lanxiang,)

37:15.159 --> 37:16.719
(and laid them to rest.)

37:18.679 --> 37:19.920
(For such great kindness,)

37:21.000 --> 37:22.639
(I'll never forget its source)

37:23.679 --> 37:25.480
(and will repay it even beyond death.)

37:30.159 --> 37:30.880
You said

37:31.679 --> 37:33.199
first, to honor an old friend.

37:34.719 --> 37:35.440
What's the second?

37:43.360 --> 37:44.159
Second,

37:46.440 --> 37:47.639
I want you to know

37:49.519 --> 37:50.760
what kind of man

37:52.159 --> 37:53.880
the husband you married truly is.

37:56.159 --> 37:57.119
The good

37:58.280 --> 37:59.199
and the bad,

38:00.519 --> 38:01.760
I want you to know it all.

38:04.559 --> 38:05.559
You once said

38:07.000 --> 38:08.199
our ways are different.

38:10.559 --> 38:11.519
I want to know

38:13.320 --> 38:14.119
where my way

38:17.320 --> 38:18.800
truly differs from yours.

38:22.408 --> 38:23.480
The person I've wronged most

38:25.000 --> 38:27.000
in this life is buried here.

38:28.639 --> 38:29.639
The thing I've done

38:29.639 --> 38:31.159
that I could never tell anyone

38:31.159 --> 38:32.039
is here, too.

38:37.840 --> 38:38.880
I'm no gentleman.

38:41.000 --> 38:41.880
I get scared.

38:43.079 --> 38:44.000
I act rashly.

38:46.239 --> 38:48.159
I may even do things deemed treasonous.

38:52.119 --> 38:53.639
But in this life,

38:56.639 --> 38:57.679
I will never fail you.

39:05.820 --> 39:08.580
♪The golden sunset♪

39:08.580 --> 39:11.900
♪sketches my thoughts♪

39:13.580 --> 39:16.180
♪All things fall silent,♪

39:16.180 --> 39:19.500
♪fearing to disturb this moment♪

39:20.340 --> 39:23.380
♪My restless heart♪

39:23.740 --> 39:27.420
♪seeks a place to anchor♪

39:27.820 --> 39:33.740
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

39:40.239 --> 39:41.039
(Father.)

39:42.440 --> 39:43.159
(Mother.)

39:45.760 --> 39:47.559
(You heard what he said, too?)

39:54.280 --> 39:55.280
Come with me,

39:56.480 --> 39:56.960
and before

39:59.360 --> 40:00.360
my savior,

40:01.239 --> 40:02.239
kowtow three times.

40:04.000 --> 40:04.960
Then I'll tell you

40:06.239 --> 40:07.000
how your way

40:08.239 --> 40:09.119
and my way

40:10.119 --> 40:11.119
differ.

40:14.840 --> 40:15.880
Not just three.

40:18.320 --> 40:19.519
Three hundred, if you like.

40:28.300 --> 40:31.220
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

40:31.220 --> 40:33.519
♪For withholding its light♪

40:33.519 --> 40:35.719
(First, bow to Heaven and Earth.)

40:36.140 --> 40:39.620
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

40:39.620 --> 40:43.740
♪Still live and thrive♪

40:43.740 --> 40:48.140
♪No longer let
the world's wind and snow fall♪

40:48.140 --> 40:50.740
♪And leave the grass and trees
covered in frost♪

40:51.480 --> 40:53.639
(Second, bow to the parents.)

40:55.540 --> 40:59.020
♪You and I will walk there together♪

40:59.020 --> 41:02.420
♪I no longer search through old dreams♪

41:02.420 --> 41:05.740
♪Leaving them buried
deep within the years♪

41:08.860 --> 41:11.039
(Husband and wife, bow to each other.)

41:11.039 --> 41:13.820
♪Toward where my heart leads♪

41:14.020 --> 41:18.340
♪I no longer lament
that fate is hard to foresee♪

41:18.340 --> 41:21.580
♪Accepting the unexpected as ordinary♪

41:21.580 --> 41:25.540
♪I only wish the road behind us
would fade like mist♪

41:25.540 --> 41:30.780
♪And we would share the road home♪

41:41.039 --> 41:44.400
♪The beacon fires of Yumen die out♪

41:44.960 --> 41:48.800
♪Qiuci's drums and horns fall still♪

41:49.920 --> 41:53.880
♪Alas, alas♪

41:56.960 --> 42:02.480
♪Glory is bought with battlefield blood♪

42:02.519 --> 42:03.840
Didn't you write a new play

42:03.840 --> 42:04.840
to be staged?

42:05.280 --> 42:06.519
Why is it just the two of us?

42:08.199 --> 42:09.320
Because this play

42:09.960 --> 42:11.079
was written only for you,

42:11.920 --> 42:12.920
for your eyes alone.

42:32.800 --> 42:34.159
Didn't you want to know

42:35.760 --> 42:36.960
how our ways

42:37.679 --> 42:38.840
differ?

43:05.300 --> 43:07.460
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.000 --> 43:11.920
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

43:12.000 --> 43:15.559
Red candles flicker,
and blossoms are sweet.

43:16.480 --> 43:21.880
Hand in hand, we laugh as one,
a pair of mandarin ducks.

43:22.599 --> 43:26.039
Unafraid of the world's wind and frost.

43:26.440 --> 43:30.039
Face to face,
dawn to dusk, love endures.

43:47.300 --> 43:51.420
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:54.260 --> 43:58.780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:00.060 --> 44:03.980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:04.660 --> 44:07.420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:08.140 --> 44:10.460
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:10.460 --> 44:13.540
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:15.060 --> 44:19.300
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:22.220 --> 44:26.380
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:28.180 --> 44:31.740
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:31.740 --> 44:35.300
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:36.100 --> 44:41.780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:42.140 --> 44:46.460
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:46.820 --> 44:49.780
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:49.780 --> 44:53.540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:53.540 --> 44:56.420
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

44:56.420 --> 45:00.500
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:00.500 --> 45:03.860
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:03.860 --> 45:07.620
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:07.620 --> 45:11.620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:12.380 --> 45:16.540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:16.540 --> 45:19.980
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:19.980 --> 45:23.620
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:23.620 --> 45:26.500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:26.500 --> 45:30.580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:30.580 --> 45:33.940
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:33.940 --> 45:37.580
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:37.580 --> 45:45.380
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
